Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/sandrastasaityte/UK-EXPENDITURE-SIDE-GDP-MODEL.git

Move into the project directory:

cd UK-EXPENDITURE-SIDE-GDP-MODEL

Create a virtual environment:

python -m venv .venv

Activate it on Windows:

.venv\Scripts\activate

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt
Running the Model

Run the complete analytical pipeline:

python main.py

The pipeline automatically runs the major analytical stages:

Phase 01 — Data Loading & Quality Control
Phase 02 — Data Cleaning
Phase 03 — GDP Identity Analysis
Phase 04 — Macroeconomic Indicators
Phase 05 — Econometrics
Phase 06 — Forecasting
Phase 07 — Dashboard
Phase 08 — Economist Report
